Zandatsu (Android, Phase 5B): Mali-G720/G1-Ultra cut-off and scissor fixes (issue #78):
- Match Immortalis-* and Mali-G1* (Lumex / Dimensity 9500) in MaliWithThreeDigits.
- Default swordman_renut_scissor_area to '16' (Mali 16x16 tile alignment, avoiding garbage blocks on G720).
- Keep boundViewport/boundScissor tracked on multi-viewport/scissor (MRT) calls so renut/0029 always re-emits.

